      'arrival' => 'Meeting point at Incheon International Airport (ICN) Terminal 1 or 2, Arrival Hall at 10:00 AM. Guide will hold "ACP Tours - Incheon" sign at Meeting Point Zone (between Gates 4-5 Terminal 1, or Gate 5-6 Terminal 2). Ideal for travelers with layovers or early arrivals. Luggage storage available at airport if needed. Provide flight details 24 hours in advance. Alternative meeting at Incheon Station (Seoul Line 1 terminal) possible. Contact: +82-32-XXX-XXXX',
      'departure' => 'Check-out 12:00 PM Day 3. Transfer to Incheon International Airport for 6:00 PM arrival. Suitable for evening or night flights (recommend 9:00 PM or later departure for international flights). Early departure possible if flight schedule requires (breakfast box provided). Airport limousine bus to Seoul option available if continuing to Seoul (₩15,000, 70 minutes).',
      'tnc' => 'BOOKING: Minimum 2 people. Ideal for layover travelers (need 48+ hour layover). PAYMENT: 40% deposit at booking, 60% balance 7 days before tour. CANCELLATION: 7+ days: 80% refund. 3-6 days: 50% refund. Less than 3 days or within 48 hours: No refund. WEATHER: Island/beach activities subject to weather and tide schedules. Alternative indoor activities provided during bad weather. Ferry to Muui-do may cancel due to rough seas. FLEXIBILITY: Itinerary adaptable based on interests - more beaches, more shopping, more culture - discuss with guide. LUGGAGE: Large luggage can stay at hotel Day 2 while visiting islands (bring day bag). Airport luggage storage available (₩4,000-6,000 per day). TRANSIT: Perfect for travelers with long layovers wanting to explore beyond airport - must have valid Korean visa or visa-free entry eligibility. SPECIAL: Jjajangmyeon (black bean noodles) and dakgangjeong (crispy chicken) are Incheon specialties - vegetarian options limited.',
      'include' => '2 nights accommodation at 4-star hotel near Incheon Chinatown (twin sharing, city view). Daily breakfast buffet. Airport round-trip transfers (arrival Day 1, departure Day 3). Professional English-speaking tour guide Days 1-3. Transportation: comfortable vehicle throughout tour. Entrance fees: Jayu Park, Incheon Grand Park cable car, Songdo Central Park. Welcome dinner Day 1 (Chinese-Korean cuisine). Water taxi ride in Songdo Canal (weather permitting). Bottled drinking water during tours. Incheon map and guidebook. Cashbee transit card with ₩5,000 credit.',
      'exclude' => 'International flights. Korea visa if required. Travel and medical insurance. Lunch all days (estimate ₩12,000-18,000 per meal). Dinner Days 2-3 (own arrangement, guide assists). Ferry to Muui-do Island if chosen (₩8,000 roundtrip). Personal expenses, shopping, souvenirs. Optional: Incheon Children\'s Museum ₩5,000, Zoo entry ₩3,000, additional water taxi rides ₩5,000, bicycle rental, water sports. Tips for guide (suggest ₩30,000 per person total). Single room supplement ₩450,000 total. Early breakfast box if needed ₩15,000. Airport lounge access. SIM card rental.',
      'nearby_hotel' => 'Paradise City Hotel (5-star integrated resort with casino, spa, indoor beach, near airport), Grand Hyatt Incheon (luxury airport hotel), Orakai Songdo Park Hotel (modern hotel in Songdo smart city), Nest Hotel Incheon (4-star near Chinatown), Oakwood Premier Incheon (serviced residences), Hotel Soho (boutique budget option), Sea & Moon Pension (island accommodation on Eurwangni Beach)',
