      'title' => 'Sokcho Mountain Paradise - 5D4N Seoraksan Hiking',
      'slug' => 'sokcho-nature-mountain-retreat',
      'description' => 'Embark on an unforgettable mountain adventure in Sokcho, gateway to magnificent Seoraksan National Park - one of Korea\'s most spectacular natural treasures and UNESCO Biosphere Reserve. This 5-day nature retreat combines challenging hiking trails through dramatic granite peaks, serene Buddhist temples nestled in mountain valleys, thrilling cable car rides to ancient fortresses, cascading waterfalls, soothing natural hot springs, and fresh seafood dining by the East Sea coast. Trek to Ulsanbawi Rock for breathtaking panoramic views, visit the giant bronze Buddha at Sinheungsa Temple, relax in healing hot spring waters, explore traditional fish markets, and wake up to mountain air and stunning sunrise views. Perfect for outdoor enthusiasts, nature photographers, hikers of moderate fitness levels, and anyone seeking rejuvenation away from urban life.',
      'country' => 'South Korea',
